            "review_title": "Review at Sri Raja Bhojanam Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Krish212hanoi\nHanoi, Vietnam35 contributions\n0\nVery Poor Experience with WHEN YOU Believe this is South Indian Restaurant\nMay 2026 • Business\nVery Poor Services, I ordered yesterday Chicken Paniyaram and there is no any Chicken, Today we believed that this restaurant as a South Indian Restaurant and order some Eggs and Chicken and disappointed again, They send only one boiled egg which is charged 31.250 VND = 113.48 INR. Where the pictures Shown as multiple eggs, Disappointed and never recommended this cheating with High priced Restaurant any more.. All the foods are high Priced and no any Value..\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nNever\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 27, 2026",
